 "provenance": "Angkor 8 (w0 l7) normal exit, start values of the old campaign chain (lives 9, campaign diamonds 70, 1 red diamond, maxHealth 4, weaponTier 1). Built on the intent of the old port route (routes/angkor-08-normal.json) with repairs on the exact core: the 19,15 health chest is kept for the way back from the upper silver key (the hero climbs column 17 directly after a pause), the old route's deliberate reset at the 33,9 checkpoint is kept (refills health, costs one life); in the combat room the 36,5 stone is dropped on the green snake (only stunnable by the hammer) and the red snake is killed with three hammer blows (sequence found by macro search); the three snakes of the 36-38 shaft are dodged on the way to the gold key chest 37,26 and back (paths found by BFS over single steps and short waits). Control-only.",
